<title>USA: Atchison Casting buys die casting firm.</title>
<headline>Atchison Casting buys die casting firm.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atchison Casting Corp said Tuesday it acquired 100 percent of the stock of Los Angeles Die Casting Inc from Ketma Inc for about $8.5 million cash.</p>
<p>Los Angeles Die Casting, based in Los Angeles, produces precision aluminum and zinc die castings for the computer, communications and recreation industries.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
